{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmIcon.vue",
    "title": "共享线条图标组件",
    "summary": "根据名称从内置路径表选择 SVG 图形，以统一尺寸、描边风格和装饰性无障碍行为。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "selection",
        "title": "图标选择与回退",
        "body": "组件提供可选 name 和 size，默认分别为 book 与 18；内置路径覆盖书籍、层级、方向、关闭、菜单、状态、链接、时间和新增等常用符号。[[c1]] 渲染时以 name 查表，未知名称不会报错或留下空白，而是回退到 book。这提高了运行时容错，但也可能掩盖拼写错误；由于 name 类型是任意字符串，编译期不能限制调用方只能选择已知图标。"
      },
      {
        "key": "rendering",
        "title": "渲染与模块关系",
        "body": "所有图标共用 24×24 viewBox、无填充、currentColor 描边以及圆角端点和连接，实际宽高由 size 同步控制，因此会继承父元素文字颜色并保持一致线条风格。SVG 标记为 aria-hidden，定位为装饰性图形；可访问名称必须由外层控件提供。[[c2]] 对话框正是将 close 图标放入带 aria-label 的 OmButton 中，展示了预期组合方式。[[c3]] 组件不支持非正方形尺寸、独立标题或多路径样式。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "图标默认值与路径字典",
        "reason": "支持名称、尺寸默认值、已知图标集合及未知名称回退逻辑的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmIcon.vue",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nwithDefaults(defineProps<{ name?: string; size?: number }>(), {\n  size: 18,\n  name: \"book\",\n});\nconst paths: Record<string, string> = {\n  book: \"M12 5v16M3 4c4-1 7 0 9 2 2-2 5-3 9-2v15c-4-1-7 0-9 2-2-2-5-3-9-2z\",\n  layers: \"m12 3 10 5-10 5L2 8zM2 12l10 5 10-5M2 16l10 5 10-5\",\n  arrow: \"m9 5 7 7"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "SVG 渲染合同",
        "reason": "说明尺寸、继承颜色、统一描边、装饰性语义和路径回退。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmIcon.vue",
          "startLine": 20,
          "endLine": 33
        },
        "quote": "<template>\n  <svg\n    :width=\"size\"\n    :height=\"size\"\n    viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke=\"currentColor\"\n    stroke-width=\"1.6\"\n    stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n  >\n    <path :d=\"paths[name] || paths.book\" />\n  </svg>"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "关闭图标的按钮组合",
        "reason": "证明上层对话框通过带 aria-label 的按钮承载装饰性 close 图标。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
          "startLine": 43,
          "endLine": 52
        },
        "quote": "    <div class=\"dialog-inner\">\n      <header>\n        <div>\n          <small v-if=\"depth\">证据路径 · 第 {{ depth }} 层</small>\n          <h2 id=\"om-dialog-title\">{{ title }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <OmButton variant=\"ghost\" aria-label=\"关闭全部\" @click=\"emit('close')\"\n          ><OmIcon name=\"close\"\n        /></OmButton>\n   "
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "name 是否应收窄为内置图标名称的联合类型，并在开发环境暴露未知名称错误？",
        "why": "当前 Record<string, string> 与 string 属性允许拼写错误静默回退为 book，可能让错误图标进入界面而不易察觉。",
        "nextStep": "导出图标名称类型，并增加已知名称、默认值与未知名称策略的渲染测试。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c2"
        ]
      }
    ]
